          "message": {
            "text": "The CI gate is manual-only while the retained independent arms are known to disagree, so it cannot make unrelated pull requests permanently red. It deliberately runs the strict command without the diagnostic allow flag and always uploads the report; DM-2588 can ratify it as required after DM-2586 and DM-2587 align the artifacts.",
            "markdown": "The CI gate is manual-only while the retained independent arms are known to disagree, so it cannot make unrelated pull requests permanently red. It deliberately runs the strict command without the diagnostic allow flag and always uploads the report; DM-2588 can ratify it as required after DM-2586 and DM-2587 align the artifacts."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": ".github/workflows/sfns-terminal-mask-adjudication.yml"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 3,
                  "endLine": 33,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "on:\n  workflow_dispatch:\n\npermissions:\n  contents: read\n\njobs:\n  adjudicate:\n    name: Exact retained proposal/validation gate\n    runs-on: macos-14\n    timeout-minutes: 10\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: 22\n          cache: npm\n      - run: npm ci\n      - name: Adjudicate exact logical records and terminal bytes\n        run: >-\n          npm run fonts:sfns-terminal-mask:adjudicate --\n          --proposal .pr-notes/artifacts/dm2577-sfns-pinned-skia-proposal.json\n          --validation .pr-notes/artifacts/dm2575-sfns-pinned-chromium-validation.json\n          --report sfns-terminal-mask-adjudication.json\n      - name: Retain adjudication report\n        if: always()\n        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          name: sfns-terminal-mask-adjudication\n          path: sfns-terminal-mask-adjudication.json\n          if-no-files-found: error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
